'contato'])?></td><td><?=e($r['email'])?></td><td><?=e($r['telefone'])?></td><td><?=e($r['status'])?></td><td class="text-end"><a class="btn btn-light btn-sm" href="?action=editar&id=<?=$r['id']?>"><i class="bi bi-pencil"></i></a> <a class="btn btn-light btn-sm" data-confirm="Excluir este registro?" href="?action=excluir&id=<?=$r['id']?>"><i class="bi bi-trash"></i></a></td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table></div></div><?php require __DIR__.'/../../includes/footer.php'; ?>